# Handoff Protocol

After meaningful work, update:
- `docs/ai-context/CURRENT_STATE.md`
- `docs/ai-context/IMPLEMENTATION_LOG.md`
- `docs/ai-context/OPEN_THREADS.md`
- `docs/ai-context/HANDOFF.md`

Update `DECISION_LOG.md` only when a durable product or technical decision changes.

Handoffs should include what changed, what works, incomplete work, validation, risks, next best task, what not to touch, and proposed Thinktank updates if relevant.
